-- Generated by editor/scripts/bake-islands.ts + build-playdate.ts -- DO NOT EDIT
-- Checked-in default: no islands have been baked into this copy of Source.
-- `cd editor && bun run bake:islands` rasterizes every render island through
-- the real Simulator into .playdate-editor/bake-islands/; `bun run
